{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1214ccfc2bf7cb5f889cc02b2ad98070ea44df67100f91c86927ea06d8e81119",
      "text": "Happy White Fest!\nAll children seeking sweets, gather!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5375d786fc041aea811c7d20b2b0d7d12d5ed063f904be347814574f69c113a7",
      "text": "The goods are right here.\nBehave yourselves and take your\nPolar Bear Cookies.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8eb476a2a08b84c716b711ec5738acb028ef1f385ffb90b15ab14d9b66967d8a",
      "text": "With this, the request from Mayor\nShibuya is complete.\nWell done, everyone.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:112bc7eb5f3819a062a563fc1fb91c014e1e0b80bfd6b82f22ab7a6964f9c053",
      "text": "Thanks for your hard work, Rolf,\nKlaus! It's great that everybody\nseemed so happy~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:30a1f5095cbe08bbc1a97ab1680f016f893dcfddb5b66de80c56291feb51ba9a",
      "text": "And those children? They did not\nseem to be among the crowd earlier.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:54c1c34600802fc503f8815498765288a84588b0f3d5b9ef41b6c3ceeb01ee6f",
      "text": "Well... they're kind of a\nrowdy bunch...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ec394ecc84c6c1903101d5819289a6eca8854476907184856591f7c06d3c6c4",
      "text": "I think they're kids who really\nlooked up to Aegis... They probably\nfeel awkward about it, you know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b3f151f87a2b41dd2f9f3c38c33f0a902c83a910cebb79e60b65adf3bf3b0e98",
      "text": "Lord Klaus. May I have your leave to\nhandle the rest of the sweets?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3e7ed3634dd09507fbf14ad6ae4b021ad90d064339e3e5df3195b25f152e6013",
      "text": "Uh-oh! This is bad!\nSome huge wolfman is coming!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c3b7dcf76abe47e22a3346f2e7e928cf62af4c1d4509a1a839de46c209a1efb",
      "text": "H-hey!\nWhat do you want here!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6b1535ba081a21fe82d0c7cdb1cefd0535f9bdac636cfc7463813d4de957b0c",
      "text": "Happy White Fest. I have come to\nhand out sweets to the children.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dfdbabd6324bd6a18ea61eb3afb1add4817c9d4bd9c034c94525ebbe0aca475d",
      "text": "Sweets...? Are you stupid!?\nDon't treat us like little kids!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0b6a935f36788222d65a26a3961d82d0e91f86c5720a1e3501a1842d306eae0d",
      "text": "All the more reason. Sweets lift\nmorale more than you think. They are\nvital supplies for strong troops too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c799102233e12d38f02697dacd7ab4d665bd6cd0b9eb939eaa6459206ab0c9d",
      "text": "Eat some and ease your mind a while.\nLaughing together with others is\nsometimes necessary, too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d879f40fd807b16d94a4550f32d31f637327b76f1a105250730b28e551c7e803",
      "text": "That's Tink and the others' alarm!?\nCould there be monsters in Shibuya—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6b990203801f509155096bd05519bf3b53c828bb2154be6c9bcf9fc31173be12",
      "text": "All hands, evacuate\ninto the building!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "62": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e04c32a44b2ef2b614a9e85bfa2064d5c4d864375a5d9b42c9e52007fb3de139",
      "text": "Lord Klaus, join me on the\nrear guard! Champions, please\nguide the children!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "66": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e072c904d0c198b98e73612cd81ccbadb6f826ff64b581f2a99dffeb335ae797",
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting. I did a\nquick scouting run outside.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "68": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9b82fc6e0f6c8f924df3db145a21a865d335445cbeda407fe0d7003e6ab32f2c",
      "text": "It's another labyrinth. Monsters are\npouring out of underground passages\nand causing damage all over Shibuya.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8674a3504b0e8e3b0bb807a8dfb694f45477b8047a63e1195a484accd6ffe0d1",
      "text": "That's terrible!\nWe have to run, fast...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2aa0a041132c67b6a96efb424e4ef2fb88d5be76b2c7212e4d93bad6f115c284",
      "text": "No. The area is already a\nbattlefield. A careless retreat\nwould invite worse danger.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:622c17182c36816954f6a1995cefb372b18a3b5561b71095ea52f4d3130fa2c7",
      "text": "Champion. I propose that we hold\nthe building under siege.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ddd3786f112d40991d803c590a17c42b952946bd06e80be9bd7d740b7215d4e1",
      "text": "Yes. For the children's safety,\nthat's the best option. In that case,\nI'll go call for reinforcements.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:452873826f613e911223092658fbaa08e2ad7bd99a2238babcdcaf1f127d3010",
      "text": "I can't fight, but I can slip past\nthe monsters.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:476ad9ede83d077e1eaeb94ff4dc5f7d4a6c1bd515165b44361912647ef3cd2e",
      "text": "Hey! We're not kids either. We can\nhold our own in a fight...\nLet us help with something!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d90b16b35ea30c64aefe424f22e4e3d4c8ed458ed8809e12a4174f59cf1c4105",
      "text": "...Your aid is worth ten thousand\nreinforcements. I shall rely on you\ngladly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5a54f66d3362b05467be1e973e84f4c85f4236c09605080e9f4c1d7ba7e9fb8a",
      "text": "Now, prepare for the siege!\nEveryone, make haste!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4c8b85f5dffd352c31744543892fb0fabcba9454885f700ba21ee07a619c9856",
      "text": "Hey, wolf mister! Bad news! Monsters\ngot into the building!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8a565a773407fd68b989056e89fd82791665d542ad877442ae9b832d68b1994c",
      "text": "They have come.\nIgnite!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:835f5fcb62c698ac232bfe01dfcaa6af3bfb2fa05c8b644bda91b8798dc3dfbe",
      "text": "...B-bombs...!?\nWhy do you even have those...!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "104": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d207258a2cece4ec5317c8fae1cf835768a07fb1e950a7ebd24a6a2865a5594e",
      "text": "Festival or not, a soldier is always\nready for battle. It is only natural.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5959fca2a696e2b69545fb314e84a89fa6483fb52edf8fd0a11dd44f37041b3e",
      "text": "R-really? I'm just glad the building\ndidn't collapse...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86ea78aef8b29f2eb2ce1164f0b0fe9d9b757f29773310f85837359476e7816a",
      "text": "Demolition is a last resort. Rest\nassured.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39781269ebcfb5cfbd5c1f8edbbef5b303e28934b9b5ad317cc4f215f8bdaee8",
      "text": "Message! Monsters are coming in\nthrough the back door!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf728bea3792802f2f7bc27a70f522b7d1a0ae277663cde7f32bf3562afcb404",
      "text": "I leave this place\nto you, Lord Klaus!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9088ce8dfebcc3e2f1a897312d7f4c3dfd683ec56e39b0b3be613ced7bbe7fb2",
      "text": "Schlachten den Ort!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eee34fe0703e45d04369bc05eace5637b6476d7fbc080993b72e972b4f8745a0",
      "text": "Whoa...\nSo cool...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "129": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:15d97c2810da9dda05d61ae4918e557c276367e844563f4fa1ab6315f8036d82",
      "text": "...Heh. This exhilaration. I had long\nforgotten it. Is this what a battle\nwithout doubt feels like?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "132": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d56676a4389b9da5cd958dc091eb46e4eee032e558a1d9b1e780bd6408c82e0d",
      "text": "Rolf...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c652ee646c4bdc87a92887c35c83fdd5d72acdc5c7e1f6c03aa3d7932c08e498",
      "text": "Not a single one shall pass.\nEveryone, fall back to the next\nbarricade!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6386365309c0e102ec484976103b79cdf2bd3ed6bfbf7180422a7da4501065bf",
      "text": "How hopeless I am. Only in the face\nof the children's danger do I finally\nreach the heart of knighthood.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fcaf0d12fe55c6c4c40303910ec66242b4a15c50ab8f4f9e39e83aabfcb95e68",
      "text": "...Gerda. You saw it clearly all\nalong, didn't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edb2e0d73e2cebdee271a651191c6d1481420c0d5a86091970cf65abbb8dcb48",
      "text": "Therefore, victory. Victory!\nVictory to all of you!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5af373e3fbfd51afedc0b980d3cf9566b51c3201ceb2edeedb4dd2c039cf89af",
      "text": "You are...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "159": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a2706cd4ff42a9c4e9b29f3ade7c4d410bfd2a9893051f3dd4d278a7d9abd4e5",
      "text": "Phew~. I'm so glad everybody got\nout safe~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "162": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bac2d97e0beefb763ef3d37f859afd61eee2315fe7d2cf47cbda82e369e67946",
      "text": "I happened to run into the Champion,\nwhich got us here right away.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:14c5651cd6344f34bf0487b10649e5954e19ecd2353996df5dc8dd86dd88a94d",
      "text": "Thank you for the rescue.\nBut you are—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1a6e3cc9444cc452c0f452e35bd2f5a8157726580839360281bf8fbf7278dda",
      "text": "We are the Company of the Fang.\nA gathering of soldiers with nowhere\nto belong.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "174": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a925efc143461fb49cb267ce2eb0f47303c65037bffeae314a230dec4d242feb",
      "text": "...Palpebra would not hold such a\nforce in reserve without reason.\nWhich means—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:52b9fd7884b56cea588f95483c545aae638d0fe89933b7dc029051a1c6ae25a4",
      "text": "You guessed it. We're in Palpebra\nbecause we were asked to be.\nThe city is in danger.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:00d50dee2d63a704af94d257891f1c941e2459066411c2e54e7a851ac1e60cb2",
      "text": "...I see.\nHa, hahaha...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6553264a3517a33a435ec0a8627fde26cf75e6c8df202eb355676cf6981372e",
      "text": "What's funny about that!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "191": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58ed4f37a328d7a5fbaf9ba82cfdbfd4cdb7bc636d643fbd9ffcd139d81dd25f",
      "text": "I have found what I must\nbecome. I can see the\npath I should believe in.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5f6d05138bdeb0ea4cdb494529bbf95f5e0ac7739d70ea165648fac24378994e",
      "text": "I can only live in battle.\nAnd I kept getting my reasons\nfor fighting wrong. But...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b3a81c1107c153fb5d75a581fcef011f1b3dfe09ebeac6d54d5f6eef6e3ef7c",
      "text": "You really are hopeless. But I think\nyou'll be fine now.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "200": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:baf8904f842fd2cb9988ba5fcd59d534f2853677b9f012afa30085cb38f8d9f6",
      "text": "Want to stand fang to fang with us,\nSir Black Wolf?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "203": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d35b312596c339d63e41e73fad334d2587090e6a83c7ea0ffcdf0670f03d2d29",
      "text": "Of course.\nBut not yet.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4721c55ce618f6674a4a6d33bb1a5ca11618ca819835c4aea78dbeaacb726694",
      "text": "Before I walk the path I believe in,\nthere is something I must do.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:386da17783abcd6ed6e9d70adf6c1ff2763d8caae6d825c44accb0ef4856c021",
      "text": "...Yeah. I guess so.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "213": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7aa3408efd7549a33f31d0e9999118f8a20e69d087408cb899ac091d7339c47",
      "text": "As the king's sword, I—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
